// Switches the email catcher on. The bundle ships in every distribution and files nothing until it is
// enabled, so this file — included only by the test and demo aggregates — is the whole of the
// difference between an instance that sends mail and one that catches it.
//
// This is the same setting the Felix console offers under "IAP Email Catcher", so an instance that did
// not start with it can be switched over by hand and back again, without a rebuild and without a
// restart. Shipping it here as well means the test and demo instances need nobody to do that.
{
    "configurations":{
        "io.uhndata.iap.emailcatcher.internal.CaughtMailService":{
            "enabled":true
        }
    }
}
